s="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_54" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0f766e;labelBackgroundColor=#faf8f5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_47" target="p1_48"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_55" value="dados prontos" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0f766e;labelBackgroundColor=#faf8f5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_48" target="p1_42"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_56" value="persist" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6b4fa8;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b4fa8;labelBackgroundColor=#faf8f5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1_49" target="p1_50"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_57" value="As páginas também leem store/ (o que o usuário mexeu), lib/ (cálculos) e config/ (as regras do modelo) — detalhe na página 3." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5f7b9c;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72" y="1078" width="1150" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_58" value="&lt;b&gt;Por que existe um backend?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Ele é um &lt;b&gt;gerador&lt;/b&gt;, não um servidor de produção: cria o portfólio com PRNG de seed fixa e o snapshot.mjs congela tudo em JSON. Em runtime o front lê só esses arquivos — por isso o protótipo publica em GitHub Pages sem Node.&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;size=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d8bf82;fontColor=#5c4a1e;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;strokeWidth=1.4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1272" y="960" width="268" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1_59" value="LEGENDA:  verde = backend/geração   ·   âmbar = dados estáticos   ·   azul = frontend/runtime   ·   verde-escuro = motores de cálculo   ·   roxo = estado do usuário   ·   vermelho = telas   ·   cinza = configuração" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a8a80;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1150" width="1500" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg2" name="2 · Backend"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0" background="#faf8f5"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p2_1" value="Backend — o gerador do portfólio" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=26;fontColor=#141413;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="20" width="1300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_2" value="backend/  ·  Express + TypeScript (tsx watch)  ·  http://localhost:4000  ·  nenhum banco: tudo é criado em memória na subida do processo" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7a7a72;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="58" width="1400" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2_3" value="ENTRADA" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a8a80;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="132" width="260" height="22" as="geometry"/></